Which will be my next move? Have I to raise or fold for this player?
My opponents will have enough tokens to raise or has he to save for another one?
Keeping track on a sheet of paper about every purchase maybe tricky and even one mistake can be costly to your strategy!
With FantaTracking you can track every moves of your opponents with just a look on your screen.
You will be able to create a tracking table simply setting the numbers of participants and your starting tokens.
Next, insert the name of every components and start to add or remove the used tokens for every purchase!

This application is "single player" which means that you cannot invite your friends on your tracking table. It's designed to improve your strategy during the auction and to give you an advantage over your opponents.

________________________________________________________________________________________

Core funtionalities:
* Quotations and player stats (since season 2015/16) updated daily;
* Summary of all the fantasy coaches (from 6 to 16) with residual credits and number of players purchased per role. All in one screen;
* Fanta coach details with residual credits and list of purchases;
* List of untied players;
* Chart with statistics of a partecipant or general data about current auction;
* Release of a players purchased with total or partial recovery of the price;
* Purchase of a player with manual search or through the list of untied players;
* Search for a player with visualization of the owber fanta coach;
* Auction mode with countdown;
* History of fanta coach purchase
